# 基本文章編集の書式のメニュー: the desktop's own and the process write the same record and
# show the same page (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. Two copies of 基本文章編集 with 30
# paragraphs (mkbig doc 30): letters of the second paragraph picked by carrying the hand
# across them, then 文字修飾 > 太字, 文字色 > 赤色 and 文字修飾 > 下線 chosen from the menu
# opened at 300,250, and saved. Record 0 of both must be the same, byte for byte; the shots
# (doc_menu_k_done, doc_menu_p_done) are compared afterwards inside the window, where the
# text is (101,125 to 682,482).
# The menu opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's row, its rows 20 apart (閉じる,
# a line, 保存 40 below 閉じる, then 表示, 編集, 書体, 文字修飾 120 below, 文字サイズ, 文字色
# 160 below); a menu beside it opens with its first row on the row it hangs from (標準, 太字
# 20 below, 下線 140 below; 黒色, 赤色 40 below). The desktop's first menu has nothing chosen
# before it; the process's first one has 文字修飾, chosen last by the desktop's. While the
# desktop's menu is open the desktop answers no sync: it is waited for instead.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
drag 160 170 420 170
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 370
wait 300
move 440 370
wait 400
move 440 390
wait 300
click 440 390
sync 600
wait 300
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 290
wait 300
move 440 290
wait 400
move 440 330
wait 300
click 440 330
sync 600
wait 300
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 210
wait 300
move 440 210
wait 400
move 440 350
wait 300
click 440 350
sync 600
wait 300
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_menu_k_done
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
drag 160 170 420 170
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 270
wait 300
click 440 270
expectsince document: command style.bold
wait 300
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 290
wait 300
move 440 290
wait 400
move 440 330
wait 300
click 440 330
expectsince document: command colour.red
wait 300
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 210
wait 300
move 440 210
wait 400
move 440 350
wait 300
click 440 350
expectsince document: command style.underline
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_menu_p_done
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect document: closed
